WEBVTT

00:01:00.875 --> 00:01:03.125
That's right, I said the chemists.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:08.184
Chemistry is the hero
of electronic communications.

00:01:08.208 --> 00:01:10.976
And my goal today is to convince you

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:12.250
to agree with me.

00:01:13.667 --> 00:01:15.559
OK, let's start simple,

00:01:15.583 --> 00:01:20.018
and take a look inside
these insanely addictive devices.

00:01:20.042 --> 00:01:22.059
Because without chemistry,

00:01:22.083 --> 00:01:25.976
what is an information
superhighway that we love,

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:29.292
would just be a really expensive,
shiny paperweight.